                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iZ1q3E92MRfRuKnNA"
                  ><p>As you inhale through the Lio device, air passes through the scent cartridge and delivers therapeutic aromas directly to your olfactory system. This process <strong>mimics the hand-to-mouth ritual </strong>you&apos;re used to, encourages deep, calming breaths that reduce stress, <strong>activates scent receptors that help interrupt habit pathways</strong>, and provides immediate sensory satisfaction without substances, all while you&apos;re breathing nothing but clean air infused with natural plant aromatics.<strong> It&apos;s science-backed support that feels natural and effective.</strong></p></div
